<!-- THE DECOY. Deliberately at the androidlib ROOT (res/, not src/main/res/),
     which README.md's "Three traps worth knowing" says is silently ignored —
     green build, no warning, no icon. Nothing in this repo had ever watched a
     build make that true; the android-build job's 2022.3 leg now requires
     ic_quickaction_decoy to be ABSENT from the APK resource table while its
     sibling under src/main/res/ is present.

     Everything but the location is identical to ic_quickaction_search.xml —
     same prefix (so the package's res/raw/quickactions_keep.xml glob would
     cover it), same shape, same viewport — so a leg that finds this in the APK
     has isolated one variable: where inside the androidlib the file sat.
     If this assertion ever goes red, the README trap is wrong and the recipe
     has a second working layout. -->
<vector xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    android:width="48dp"
    android:height="48dp"
    android:viewportWidth="96"
    android:viewportHeight="96">
